# BlueROV2 Heavy navigating like the real thing: no GPS underwater, DVL (Water Linked A50 class) dead reckoning via
# MAVLink VISION_POSITION_DELTA (what the BlueOS DVL extension sends), baro depth, compass yaw.
GPS_TYPE 0
VISO_TYPE 1
EK3_SRC1_POSXY 6
EK3_SRC1_VELXY 6
EK3_SRC1_POSZ 1
EK3_SRC1_VELZ 0
EK3_SRC1_YAW 1
WPNAV_SPEED 60
WPNAV_ACCEL 60
WPNAV_SPEED_DN 40
WPNAV_SPEED_UP 40
SYSID_THISMAV 2
